<div class="wrap"><a class="btn" href="/admin">← Operations</a><section class="panel" style="margin-top:24px"><div class="panel-h"><h3>Trace a job through collection and delivery</h3></div><form class="toolbar" method="get" action="/admin/trace"><label>Source-qualified job ID <input name="jobId" value="<%= jobId %>" placeholder="linkedin:123456789" maxlength="200" required></label><button class="btn btn-sig">Trace job</button></form><div class="rail-body"><p>Delivery totals are aggregated across recipients. A job can appear in the Wire without matching anyone’s email preferences.</p><% if(jobId){ %><h3>Discovery</h3><% if(!records.length){ %><p>No retained discovery record found. It may be undiscovered, older than the 14-day history, or have a different source ID.</p><% } %><% records.forEach(j=>{ %><p><strong><%= j.title %></strong><br>Collected <%= new Date(j.firstSeenAt).toISOString() %> · <%= j.matched===false?'Not matched to search':'Matched to search' %></p><% }) %><h3>Email obligations</h3><% if(!states.length){ %><p>No retained outbox records found. This alone does not prove a delivery failure; inspect subscriptions and interests.</p><% } %><% states.forEach(s=>{ %><p><%= s._id==='sent'?'Provider accepted':s._id %>: <%= s.count %></p><% }) %><p>Inbox receipt is not measured.</p><% } %></div></section></div>